WEBVTT

00:00:16.190 --> 00:00:18.570
Jo San, how are things over there?

00:00:18.980 --> 00:00:20.400
Houhou is missing.

00:00:20.770 --> 00:00:24.450
Go inside and explain the 
situation to the Tenshi.

00:00:24.970 --> 00:00:26.080
Hold on.

00:00:27.700 --> 00:00:33.190
The Tenshi must be doing something 
inside to produce this much light.

00:00:33.190 --> 00:00:35.830
And this is no small disturbance.

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:38.870
The Tenshi must have noticed.

00:00:50.520 --> 00:00:51.710
Master...

00:00:52.310 --> 00:00:55.010
That's the third time.

00:00:55.010 --> 00:00:56.480
What's going on?

00:00:57.130 --> 00:01:01.260
I don't think I did anything wrong.

00:01:01.820 --> 00:01:06.200
Do you not want to become the Tenshi?

00:01:07.050 --> 00:01:12.400
If you really want me to become the 
Tenshi, I want you to answer one thing.

00:01:13.080 --> 00:01:16.540
My question has nothing to 
do with the Koushin War.

00:02:47.850 --> 00:02:53.770
<b>19:  Juuni               Roujoujin</b>

00:02:54.280 --> 00:02:55.350
Let me through.

00:02:55.350 --> 00:02:57.570
We can't afford to wait any longer.

00:02:56.900 --> 00:03:11.000
<b><i>Hitorinoshita -The Outcast</i> comic is now being published in Shonen JUMP+!</b>

00:02:57.570 --> 00:03:00.220
Calm down, Jo San-san.

00:03:00.220 --> 00:03:02.130
This is no time to be calm.

00:03:02.130 --> 00:03:06.080
If you won't produce the Tenshi, 
then I'm forcing my way in.

00:03:14.170 --> 00:03:15.230
Soran-kun?

00:03:20.130 --> 00:03:23.470
Like grandfather, like son.

00:03:23.470 --> 00:03:25.850
Honestly, you are exasperating.

00:03:26.140 --> 00:03:30.410
Master, I wasn't trying to 
make you angry on purpose.

00:03:32.190 --> 00:03:35.530
Soran, because of you,

00:03:35.530 --> 00:03:41.520
the reputation of the Raten Taishou that 
enlivened outsider society will surely fall.

00:03:41.520 --> 00:03:42.650
Master,

00:03:43.840 --> 00:03:46.790
criticizing me now won't help anything.

00:03:46.790 --> 00:03:48.880
No matter how you look at it,

00:03:48.880 --> 00:03:51.910
this isn't the time to teach 
me the way of the Tenshi.

00:03:52.610 --> 00:03:56.180
The Tenshifu need your strength.

00:03:57.620 --> 00:04:03.470
Honestly... Everyone's 
always causing problems.

00:04:08.150 --> 00:04:08.970
No way...

00:04:09.250 --> 00:04:11.380
Wait, Tenshi!

00:04:15.860 --> 00:04:17.470
Are you all right, Senpai?

00:04:19.570 --> 00:04:23.310
The shouitsu style's 
Kinkouju is no big deal.

00:04:25.660 --> 00:04:28.220
It seems your rules prevent you

00:04:28.220 --> 00:04:31.750
from indulging in your desires 
or experiencing pleasure,

00:04:32.170 --> 00:04:38.790
but if you lead such restrictive lives, 
you'll never reach the level we have.

00:04:39.270 --> 00:04:45.060
To reach your maximum potential, 
you need to face your true nature.

00:04:45.880 --> 00:04:50.200
Only by ignoring what others think, 
following our true nature,

00:04:50.200 --> 00:04:55.350
and doing what we want can we improve.

00:04:55.790 --> 00:05:00.650
That's the teaching of 
Zensei's founder, Youshu.

00:05:01.970 --> 00:05:03.420
What's wrong?

00:05:03.420 --> 00:05:05.800
Was I so right, you can't even respond?

00:05:05.800 --> 00:05:10.990
The only thing you're good at is laying 
out fallacious arguments, boy.

00:05:10.990 --> 00:05:12.250
Who are you?!

00:05:20.270 --> 00:05:22.800
Damn it! He won't budge!

00:05:22.800 --> 00:05:29.510
Even if giving one of your hairs 
would benefit the world, you don't.

00:05:30.070 --> 00:05:33.810
That's the logic of your founder, Youshu.

00:05:34.210 --> 00:05:38.900
But that's only one side 
of Zensei's teachings.

00:05:39.750 --> 00:05:46.450
Even if taking a single hair from another 
would harm the world, you don't.

00:05:47.190 --> 00:05:50.210
That's the other side to his teaching.

00:05:51.180 --> 00:05:55.400
You refuse to give or take a single hair.

00:05:56.170 --> 00:06:04.070
Ordinary men like us claim we've succeeded 
by overcoming the world's temptations,

00:06:04.700 --> 00:06:10.550
but your founder Youshu's 
ambition was far loftier:

00:06:11.110 --> 00:06:15.370
letting go of everything in this world.

00:06:16.090 --> 00:06:19.710
But this principle is too extreme.

00:06:19.710 --> 00:06:22.990
Youshu himself may have 
been able to achieve it,

00:06:23.740 --> 00:06:27.610
but if ordinary men like you 
or I were to follow that path,

00:06:28.000 --> 00:06:30.640
we'd stray from it.

00:06:31.030 --> 00:06:34.500
Just like you are right now.

00:06:35.540 --> 00:06:39.750
You believe that only one side of 
Youshu's teachings is everything.

00:06:40.510 --> 00:06:46.970
That Zensei means staying true to 
the character you were born with.

00:06:47.750 --> 00:06:51.930
You're simply being controlled 
by your desires.

00:06:52.520 --> 00:06:58.800
Heretics who are slaves to their desires 
and only cause problems all over the place

00:06:59.360 --> 00:07:03.470
have no right to call themselves Zensei!

00:07:10.400 --> 00:07:12.520
After living for over a hundred years,

00:07:12.520 --> 00:07:15.520
I didn't expect to have another 
opportunity to fight someone.

00:07:16.740 --> 00:07:21.120
Well, I suppose I should go loosen up.

00:07:35.220 --> 00:07:37.140
T-Tenshi!

00:07:37.140 --> 00:07:40.130
How undisciplined.

00:07:40.430 --> 00:07:44.260
I can't believe you were 
panicking over these men.

00:07:46.180 --> 00:07:47.580
Die!

00:07:50.720 --> 00:07:53.730
This is the power of the Tenshi's Kinkouju?

00:07:53.730 --> 00:07:56.110
Not even a headbutt from that 
hard-headed guy could break it!

00:07:57.740 --> 00:07:59.220
You're mine!

00:07:59.700 --> 00:08:02.500
No one's faster than me!

00:08:06.140 --> 00:08:07.840
Good grief.

00:08:09.390 --> 00:08:12.490
Children sure do enjoy running around.

00:08:13.140 --> 00:08:17.310
But they'd better watch their step.

00:08:17.710 --> 00:08:19.280
I-Incredible...

00:08:19.280 --> 00:08:22.220
I've never seen the Tenshi fight before.

00:08:22.220 --> 00:08:24.180
Was that Kinkouju, too?

00:08:24.530 --> 00:08:27.970
That's the 65th Tenshi, Chou Jiei!

00:08:28.270 --> 00:08:30.050
I'm starting to get excited!

00:08:30.050 --> 00:08:33.270
I don't care if I die, 
if it means fighting him!

00:08:33.940 --> 00:08:36.250
I'll finish him off!

00:08:36.860 --> 00:08:40.030
You can't beat the Tenshi!

00:08:40.030 --> 00:08:41.780
You can't know until you try!

00:08:41.780 --> 00:08:43.660
Prepare yourself, old man!

00:08:45.180 --> 00:08:47.680
H-Hey, let's get out of here.

00:08:47.680 --> 00:08:50.030
Yeah. We don't stand a chance against him!

00:08:50.350 --> 00:08:53.300
Damn it, I refuse to die here!

00:09:15.850 --> 00:09:18.800
Gyakusei Sanjuu and Tsuutenroku.

00:09:18.800 --> 00:09:21.450
He's using some troublesome techniques.

00:09:23.650 --> 00:09:25.460
Rikukin-senpai.

00:09:25.460 --> 00:09:28.640
Would you mind leaving now?

00:09:29.030 --> 00:09:31.650
The mountain is swarming 
with Zensei members.

00:09:32.050 --> 00:09:35.050
Why don't you vent your 
frustrations on them instead?

00:09:35.590 --> 00:09:38.250
Naturally, I intend to,

00:09:38.250 --> 00:09:41.800
after I finish off you and that giant.

00:09:41.800 --> 00:09:43.560
Good grief.

00:09:43.560 --> 00:09:47.770
I know society doesn't like Zensei,

00:09:47.770 --> 00:09:51.800
but I don't remember doing anything 
to earn the ire of the Riku family.

00:09:51.800 --> 00:09:56.950
Does this have something to 
do with your miserly master?

00:09:57.400 --> 00:09:58.560
You bastard!

00:09:58.560 --> 00:10:01.220
You won't get away with insulting my master!

00:10:01.220 --> 00:10:02.860
Bang, bang, bang!

00:10:11.040 --> 00:10:15.370
<i>Not even two enchanters and a 
defensive weapon can stop him.</i>

00:10:16.580 --> 00:10:18.840
<i>He's an unbelievable monster.</i>

00:10:19.520 --> 00:10:21.940
Calm down, Rikukin-sama.

00:10:21.940 --> 00:10:24.210
You can't let him provoke you.

00:10:24.480 --> 00:10:27.050
Shut up! Stay out of this, brat!

00:10:27.680 --> 00:10:31.270
Don't talk to me like that, you old fart.

00:10:31.270 --> 00:10:33.040
How dare you call me that?!

00:10:33.040 --> 00:10:34.390
I'll start with you!

00:10:37.000 --> 00:10:39.650
Bastard! What did you do?

00:10:40.210 --> 00:10:44.640
Reigyoku, protect your Zujueyin 
Ganjingxue and Shoushaoyin Xinjinxue.

00:10:45.630 --> 00:10:47.200
<i>What am I...</i>

00:10:49.410 --> 00:10:54.170
I feel like I said something 
incredibly rude to you.

00:10:54.490 --> 00:10:57.730
Our hatred was amplified.

00:10:57.730 --> 00:11:02.000
It seems we fell into their trap.

00:11:03.030 --> 00:11:06.640
I even gave you a chance to flee.

00:11:06.910 --> 00:11:11.940
If you fall here today, there's 
one thing I want you to remember:

00:11:12.300 --> 00:11:15.430
I bore you no ill will.

00:11:20.020 --> 00:11:21.170
I knew it.

00:11:21.170 --> 00:11:23.200
Kounei of Raienhou.

00:11:27.680 --> 00:11:30.050
Kiyuuroku Unfuukeifu!

00:11:31.990 --> 00:11:33.470
<i>What are these talismans?</i>

00:11:33.470 --> 00:11:35.740
<i>My meridian system's being suppressed!</i>

00:11:36.780 --> 00:11:37.490
<i>Damn.</i>

00:11:37.920 --> 00:11:41.370
<i>When that baldy's near me, 
I feel irresistibly gloomy.</i>

00:11:41.970 --> 00:11:43.330
Shijuu Raifu!

00:11:49.450 --> 00:11:50.560
Tou Bai, huh?

00:11:54.640 --> 00:11:57.490
Rikukin-senpai, you must know...

00:11:57.960 --> 00:12:00.820
What makes the Zensei's Four 
Sorcerers so terrifying

00:12:00.820 --> 00:12:03.370
is their ability to crush a person's spirit.

00:12:04.410 --> 00:12:10.550
Your Gyakusei Sanjuu and Tsuutenroku 
won't work against them.

00:12:11.730 --> 00:12:13.820
Let me handle this.

00:12:14.410 --> 00:12:15.640
Disperse!

00:12:16.380 --> 00:12:18.040
Don't, Reigyoku.

00:12:18.040 --> 00:12:21.160
Don't distract yourself by using kung fu.

00:12:21.160 --> 00:12:23.040
Get out of here.

00:12:23.440 --> 00:12:26.110
I can't leave you here.

00:12:32.080 --> 00:12:33.600
Rikukin-sama?

00:12:33.600 --> 00:12:35.320
Let me handle this.

00:12:35.660 --> 00:12:39.280
Zensei's Four Sorcerers are strong.

00:12:39.770 --> 00:12:46.150
But today I'll kill those heretics, 
even if it costs me my own life.

00:12:47.780 --> 00:12:52.800
I wish I could've finished off the 
last remaining Sorcerer here.

00:12:52.800 --> 00:12:55.630
Are you talking about me?

00:12:58.500 --> 00:13:05.870
The reason I didn't attack was because 
you were too attractive to kill.

00:13:06.160 --> 00:13:07.420
Natsuka?

00:13:07.420 --> 00:13:10.510
Please, it's been so long since 
we last saw each other.

00:13:10.810 --> 00:13:13.580
Don't scowl like that.

00:13:19.340 --> 00:13:21.120
What's wrong, Grandfather?

00:13:21.510 --> 00:13:23.980
You seem exhausted.

00:13:24.420 --> 00:13:27.100
Did something bad happen?

00:13:28.730 --> 00:13:31.110
What are you doing, Dad?

00:13:31.630 --> 00:13:33.660
Grandpa, hurry.

00:13:33.660 --> 00:13:35.800
Your food's getting cold, Uncle.

00:13:35.800 --> 00:13:37.850
Let's eat together.

00:13:37.850 --> 00:13:40.140
Don't just stand there.

00:13:40.750 --> 00:13:43.610
Grandfather, come here.

00:13:44.030 --> 00:13:46.000
You don't need to push yourself.

00:13:47.190 --> 00:13:50.130
Everyone's waiting for you.

00:14:06.140 --> 00:14:07.530
Rikukin-san.

00:14:09.010 --> 00:14:11.640
Surely there's no need 
to go to such lengths.

00:14:12.840 --> 00:14:17.780
You're still obsessed with destroying Zensei, 
even though you're over a hundred now.

00:14:18.710 --> 00:14:21.910
Why don't you stop already?

00:14:24.430 --> 00:14:26.800
I'm stubborn, you know.

00:14:27.280 --> 00:14:31.900
I won't stop until I've 
exterminated all of you.

00:14:32.400 --> 00:14:36.850
I have the power to remove people's pain.

00:14:37.650 --> 00:14:40.380
I'll make sure your death isn't painful.

00:14:42.050 --> 00:14:45.620
Tou Bai, Rikukin-senpai isn't that weak.

00:14:46.390 --> 00:14:50.270
It's crazy to think you can control 
him in such a short amount of time.

00:14:51.020 --> 00:14:56.000
We should capture him instead and 
take our time torturing him at home.

00:15:00.220 --> 00:15:03.280
Rikukin-sama, hang in there.

00:15:03.280 --> 00:15:05.060
I told you to retreat.

00:15:05.060 --> 00:15:05.980
But...

00:15:07.330 --> 00:15:14.150
The Juuni Roujoujin Kounei created affects 
the twelve jingmai of anyone who enters it.

00:15:15.020 --> 00:15:19.730
The twelve jingmai correspond to your 
positive and negative emotions.

00:15:20.810 --> 00:15:23.630
He wears his opponents down

00:15:23.630 --> 00:15:29.010
by continuously switching between 
their positive and negative emotions.

00:15:29.340 --> 00:15:34.710
Just as a wire breaks if you bend it enough, 
the spirit is eventually destroyed.

00:15:35.710 --> 00:15:38.800
You become unable to escape 
from your negative emotions,

00:15:38.800 --> 00:15:42.700
and the organ corresponding to 
that jingmai is severely damaged.

00:15:44.150 --> 00:15:50.340
That Tou Bai woman has the power to 
attack a person's mind and weaken it.

00:15:51.220 --> 00:15:54.950
Their powers work well together.

00:15:56.050 --> 00:15:58.640
I'll say it one last time, Reigyoku.

00:15:59.420 --> 00:16:02.990
We're inside the Juuni Roujoujin.

00:16:03.430 --> 00:16:08.910
They're focusing most of their power 
on me to prevent me from acting.

00:16:09.370 --> 00:16:11.700
You should get out of here.

00:16:12.190 --> 00:16:13.780
But Rikukin-sama...

00:16:17.540 --> 00:16:20.910
Don't forget about me.

00:16:28.480 --> 00:16:29.660
Now, then...

00:16:30.140 --> 00:16:32.330
Let me handle him.

00:16:32.330 --> 00:16:35.380
You guys finish off the old man.

00:16:36.540 --> 00:16:38.510
That hussy.

00:16:38.510 --> 00:16:41.900
She always acts indiscriminately 
when she sees young men.

00:16:46.170 --> 00:16:48.080
That's a relief.

00:16:48.470 --> 00:16:51.790
I was nearing my limit.

00:16:52.530 --> 00:16:55.110
Kounei, you win.

00:16:55.870 --> 00:16:59.690
If you want to plunge 
my heart into darkness,

00:17:00.170 --> 00:17:02.800
I'll leap into it for you!

00:17:03.830 --> 00:17:07.030
Be careful, everyone.

00:17:08.160 --> 00:17:12.790
Hey, we'd better take him out right now.

00:17:12.790 --> 00:17:14.660
We won't get another chance like this.

00:17:15.790 --> 00:17:20.440
Don't worry. We've got him in the bag.

00:17:20.970 --> 00:17:23.960
It just takes a bit of 
work to finish him off.

00:17:31.160 --> 00:17:33.830
He made a bold choice.

00:17:33.860 --> 00:17:36.220
<b>Calculation</b>

00:17:33.860 --> 00:17:39.780
<b>Rage</b>

00:17:33.860 --> 00:17:39.780
<b>Love</b>

00:17:34.450 --> 00:17:39.780
He used what little self-control he 
had left to modulate his emotions.

00:17:40.100 --> 00:17:43.920
With his Gyakusei Sanjuu active, 
he removed the protections

00:17:43.920 --> 00:17:49.760
from his Zujueyin Ganjingxue and 
Shoushaoyin Xinjinxue to amplify his rage.

00:17:50.120 --> 00:17:55.870
He used my Juuni Roujoujin to turn 
himself into a weapon of mass murder.

00:17:56.950 --> 00:18:00.750
It allows him to maximize his strength,

00:18:01.510 --> 00:18:04.590
but it's also the most dangerous method.

00:18:06.100 --> 00:18:11.090
He's abandoned all rational and calm 
thought and plunged himself into madness

00:18:12.090 --> 00:18:15.620
in order to kill everyone here.

00:18:22.470 --> 00:18:23.910
Move, Natsuka!

00:18:23.910 --> 00:18:26.130
I'm going to save Rikukin-sama!

00:18:26.130 --> 00:18:28.400
Don't bother.

00:18:28.400 --> 00:18:32.160
You'd only get in his way.

00:18:32.800 --> 00:18:35.090
Besides, didn't you feel that?

00:18:35.660 --> 00:18:42.230
Whose murderous intent do you think 
you felt the moment you left?

00:18:42.620 --> 00:18:44.400
Stop wasting your breath!

00:18:44.400 --> 00:18:46.990
If you won't move, then I—

00:18:47.350 --> 00:18:49.510
What will you do?

00:18:52.470 --> 00:18:54.020
Have you gained weight?

00:18:54.430 --> 00:18:56.970
Stop it! Don't touch me!

00:18:56.970 --> 00:18:59.540
I don't intend to settle 
things with you today!

00:18:59.540 --> 00:19:00.610
Now move!

00:19:00.610 --> 00:19:01.980
No.

00:19:03.440 --> 00:19:08.740
If you want to save Rikukin, 
you'll have to beat me first.

00:19:08.740 --> 00:19:10.570
Stop! Let go of me!

00:19:10.570 --> 00:19:14.280
If you insist on getting in my way, 
I won't show any mercy!

00:19:14.280 --> 00:19:15.840
You're really going to fight me?

00:19:18.270 --> 00:19:20.210
This tight body...

00:19:20.460 --> 00:19:21.730
And...

00:19:22.470 --> 00:19:24.360
This shapely ass!

00:19:24.360 --> 00:19:25.940
It bring back memories!

00:19:29.830 --> 00:19:33.200
Now, defeat me.

00:19:34.150 --> 00:19:35.490
I intend to!

00:19:40.400 --> 00:19:43.500
Don't actually hit me, you piece of shit!

00:19:43.500 --> 00:19:44.380
Let go!

00:19:44.380 --> 00:19:45.430
No!

00:19:45.430 --> 00:19:46.190
Stop!

00:19:46.190 --> 00:19:47.820
I don't have time to joke around with you!

00:19:47.820 --> 00:19:49.040
You insensitive bastard!

00:19:57.670 --> 00:20:00.430
Natsuka, please.

00:20:00.920 --> 00:20:01.840
Leave this place.

00:20:09.840 --> 00:20:11.890
You still taste the same.

00:20:13.470 --> 00:20:15.920
It seems you really do want to die.

00:20:22.050 --> 00:20:23.310
That day,

00:20:24.780 --> 00:20:27.200
I accepted myself.

00:20:28.610 --> 00:20:34.570
And on that same day, 
you thought you'd made a mistake.

00:20:36.250 --> 00:20:40.500
I was glad when I saw your 
fight against Chou Soran.

00:20:41.330 --> 00:20:47.320
I thought you'd cleared your mind of 
doubt and finally accepted yourself.

00:20:48.430 --> 00:20:52.210
But it seems I was wrong.

00:20:54.230 --> 00:20:56.270
Stupid me.

00:20:57.360 --> 00:21:00.430
What's so bad about the 
time you spent with me?

00:21:02.000 --> 00:21:05.160
Why are you determined 
to make yourself suffer?

00:21:08.150 --> 00:21:10.280
Because you changed.

00:21:10.910 --> 00:21:16.080
You became a Zensei heretic, 
and you... you...

00:21:16.080 --> 00:21:17.820
Became gaudy?

00:21:18.310 --> 00:21:20.450
Or a slut?

00:21:24.310 --> 00:21:27.540
You truly are a noble monk of the Tenshifu.

00:21:28.630 --> 00:21:31.760
You can't even bring yourself 
to say it out loud.

00:21:38.400 --> 00:21:39.870
I...

00:23:22.420 --> 00:23:23.670
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:23.050 --> 00:23:25.620
Alone together in a deserted forest.

00:23:25.620 --> 00:23:27.490
Could this be your alleged girlfriend?

00:23:27.490 --> 00:23:28.800
No, Master!

00:23:28.800 --> 00:23:30.180
She's a stranger!

00:23:30.180 --> 00:23:32.560
Then what were you doing with a stranger?

00:23:32.560 --> 00:23:35.400
Trying out a new kung fu technique!

